<?xml version="1.0"?>
<clickhouse>
  <!--
    Shared dev-stack memory budget (issues/28, supersedes INFRA-1279).

    Measured root cause (issues/28): ClickHouse 26.5 AUTO-SIZES every cache to a
    fixed fraction of the server memory budget. At a 4 GiB container with a
    2.5-3.0 GiB cap, system.server_settings showed mark_cache, index_mark_cache,
    uncompressed_cache, primary_index_cache, text_index_postings_cache and
    vector_similarity_index_cache each at 2 GiB (iceberg 1 GiB, parquet 512 MiB)
    — a total cache budget of ~14 GiB inside a 4 GiB box. The anonymous-RSS floor
    therefore TRACKED whatever max_server_memory_usage we set (boot floor 2.43 GiB
    at a 2.5 cap, 2.62 GiB at a 3.0 cap) and climbed to the cap within minutes,
    so even trivial queries returned Code 241 (MEMORY_LIMIT_EXCEEDED). Raising the
    cap was cosmetic — that is why 1.757/2.5/3.0 all failed identically.

     Fix: bound the caches explicitly below (~800 MiB total — dev datasets are a
     few small tables per project, this is generous). With the floor pinned well
     under the cap, 3.0 GiB leaves ~0.2-0.3 GiB of headroom above the measured
     steady-state anon floor (2.76-2.92 GiB on the shared volume). The 4 GiB
     cgroup keeps a further ~1.0 GiB kernel margin so the kernel never OOM-kills the
     server; an oversized query hits the soft 241 first. Measured 90s soak
     (25/25 ok, no Code 241) with caches bounded and MALLOC_CONF decay active.

    jemalloc page-return tuning lives in docker-compose.shared.yml as MALLOC_CONF:
    the <jemalloc> config block here was empirically ignored by 26.5 (decay had no
    effect; system.jemalloc_config table does not exist in this build).
  -->
  <max_server_memory_usage>3221225472</max_server_memory_usage>

  <!-- Explicit cache bounds — stop the ~2 GiB-each auto-sizing from the memory budget -->
  <mark_cache_size>268435456</mark_cache_size>
  <index_mark_cache_size>268435456</index_mark_cache_size>
  <primary_index_cache_size>67108864</primary_index_cache_size>
  <uncompressed_cache_size>0</uncompressed_cache_size>
  <text_index_postings_cache_size>67108864</text_index_postings_cache_size>
  <text_index_header_cache_size>16777216</text_index_header_cache_size>
  <text_index_tokens_cache_size>16777216</text_index_tokens_cache_size>
  <vector_similarity_index_cache_size>67108864</vector_similarity_index_cache_size>
  <iceberg_metadata_files_cache_size>33554432</iceberg_metadata_files_cache_size>
  <parquet_metadata_cache_size>33554432</parquet_metadata_cache_size>
  <query_cache>
    <max_size_in_bytes>0</max_size_in_bytes>
  </query_cache>
</clickhouse>
